Content:
Recently I was told that a PC case I was looking at weighed 15.8kg (by ChatGPT);
I found the weight very strange for the particular case so I asked the AI to fact check it, 
it return with "the case is 35lbs so 15.8kg"; 
I went onto the website to check & it said that the volume of the case is 35l,
ChatGPT apologized for mistaking liters for pounds after I pointed out the error...

Cool 🙃
